<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>TANKERS - Capricorn - (built 1975) 31,529 dwt sold to Greek buyers for $4.9 million.</p>
<p>SOLD FOR DEMOLITION - Servet Kalkavan - (built 1976) 16,484 dwt sold to Turkish breakers for $102 per ldt.</p>
<p>Orantus - (built 1972) 14,036 dwt sold to Indian breakers for $177 per ldt.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to inspection, survey or other conditions.</p>
</text>
